+M
 Exit before auth from <::ffff:1.2.3.4:47810>: (user 'root', 0 fails): Error reading: Connection reset by peer
 101 1.2.3.4 4 2
 M
+Exit before auth from <[::ffff:1.2.3.4]:47810>: (user 'root', 0 fails): Error reading: Connection reset by peer
+101 1.2.3.4 4 2
+M
